{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And he went.</b> He went to every tribe individually, to inform them that he was dying, so they would not be afraid, and to strengthen their hearts with the words of Joshua. Therefore it is written after it, 'And you shall cause them to inherit it.' In my opinion, it was then that he blessed the tribes — and if their blessings are later in the letter [i.e., Scripture]."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:25:34.920632785Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}